  "body": "Seems we cant keep long living connections alive. (Not request pooling ala keep-alive) but on a request level....so 1 request will ECONNRESET after 5 minutes.\r\nIn Https one can add  socket.setKeepAlive(true, 240000); on a per socket level...so requests wont be collected by the other side.\r\n",
